("An action potential is typically initiated at the {{c1::axon initial segment}}.","Neuron"),
("The fine interwoven mesh of processes and synapses in CNS gray matter is {{c1::neuropil}}.","Neuron"),
("Most somatic motor neurons have {{c1::multipolar}} morphology.","Neuron"),
("The characteristic morphology of dorsal root ganglion primary sensory neurons is {{c1::pseudounipolar}}.","Neuron"),
("A neuron with one dendrite and one axon is {{c1::bipolar}}.","Neuron"),
("Neuronal dendrites primarily {{c1::receive}} signals.","Neuron"),
("A neuron has {{c1::one}} axon in the usual morphologic classification.","Neuron"),
